# Neon Postgres connection string (free plan). On Vercel, the Neon integration in the Storage tab injects this.
# Leave it unset locally: the app then uses an embedded Postgres stored in .data/.
#
# This is the only setting the app uses. AI generation, GitHub, deploys and integrations are all
# simulated, so no API keys are needed and nothing can run up a bill.
DATABASE_URL=
